> f(x: u8) = x >> 2
> g(x: u8) = (x >> 2) + (x == 1 ? 1 : 0)
> equiv f g
f and g differ at 1 point, e.g. x=1: 0 vs 1
> equiv g f
g and f differ at 1 point, e.g. x=1: 1 vs 0
> range f
range of f -> u8:
  0..63   (64 distinct values)
  values: 0..63
  fits in u6
  over all 256 points of the domain
> range g
range of g -> u8:
  0..63   (64 distinct values)
  values: 0..63
  fits in u6
  over all 256 points of the domain
